\subsection*{Comment}

The open problem is the unconditional all-dimensional existence of a fiducial
satisfying both conditions in Eq.~\eqref{eq:p19-zauner-sic-condition}.  It is
strictly stronger than Weyl--Heisenberg-covariant SIC existence in Problem~18.

